"The Contract behind the System is a stable, global agglomerate spell."
"It is the largest magical undertaking in Artonan history."
"It took nearly a third of the Artonan magic-capable population."
"Its first version, nearly two thousand years ago, was beautifully simple and effective."
"Its purpose was managing a problem that can never be truly solved."
"Each System version balances control of its planet against bleeding resources."
"Each generation of the System grows more complicated than the last."
"Committees at the top of wizarding society fight endlessly over the System's design."
"The view of Avowed as holy gifts began the selection of Avowed from resource worlds."
"Only that view gives Avowed extraordinary power and the tools to use it."
